  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium bowl, combine garlic, plant-based mince, fine breadcrumbs (see ingredients), the egg, Italian herbs and the salt. Season with pepper.\n• Shape the mixture into burger patties (one per person), slightly larger than the burger buns.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4de6329c8e5b722b35c/step-1e2b9900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based burger patties until browned and heated through, 2-3 minutes each side. Transfer to a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle Cheddar cheese over each patty.\n• Place bake-at-home burger buns on the same tray. Bake until cheese is melted and buns are warmed through, 4-5 minutes. TIP: For even browning, gently press down on the patties using a spatula.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4de6329c8e5b722b35c/step-dd6eb410.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice apple (see ingredients). Thinly slice tomato into rounds. Thinly slice brown onion.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat. Add another drizzle of olive oil, if needed. Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the brown sugar, the balsamic vinegar (for the onion) and a splash of water. Mix well and cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4de6329c8e5b722b35c/step-ce16ea20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the balsamic vinegar (for the salad) and a drizzle of olive oil. Add baby spinach leaves (reserve a handful for the burgers!) and apple. Season, then toss to coat.\n• Slice burger buns in half. Spread the bases with mustard mayo. Top with a plant-based patty, tomato, reserved spinach leaves and caramelised onion.\n• Serve with apple salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683fb4de6329c8e5b722b35c/step-95380b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
